'''Sheria - Kirin''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the Event Gacha during [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 205
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Sheria - Kirin
|name2 = Sheria - KirinX
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sheria - KirinX''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
While she does boast solid stats against Floating enemies, Sheria's build doesn't do her well. Foremost, she has massive cooldown—the exact same as [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat's]]. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], despite having lower effective DPS than Sheria, outpace her simply due to being able to accumulate a stack faster. Another flaw is that her Single Target does not bode well with her targeting. Floating enemies tend to appear in large numbers, so picking them off one-by-one isn't the best strategy and is hence the reason why Cameraman's and [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]'s [[Area Attack|Area Attacks]] are so valuable. If a single Floating enemy needs to be defeated, [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] does the job faster due to his higher effective DPS and speed. The one perk that Sheria keeps is her solid 49k effective HP. That's enough to take a hit from a 2,000% magnification [[Teacher Bun Bun]] without needing Catseyes! However, Cameraman already accomplishes this as well as with every other enemy due to her [[Survive|Survive]] ability and other [[Talents]].

